    "creative": "Model-call tox offers led. Purefico's image, 'Cornelius, tox and filler models wanted', tox at $9.99 a unit or $100 off filler, brought 31 Meta leads at $6.98. Sanctuaire's video with the same offer, 'accepting 15 tox and filler models this month', brought 20. Starwood's image, 'looking for 20 women to try our Mini Mommy Makeover' at $249, brought 21. Worth testing the model-call opening at Dr Chase, where 6 leads reached the CRM at $28.15 each.",
    "doing": "The spas brought 169 leads into their CRMs at $20.51 each, up from 159 at $22.05 the week before, on less spend. That cost covers the spas with a CRM connected. Purefico brought 35 at $9.76 each and Bellatox KY 34 at $14.30.",
